# cabal v2-update
Downloading the latest package list from test-local-repo
# cabal v2-vendor
Resolving dependencies...
Vendored 2 packages into vendor

To build using the vendored packages, add the following to the project file
(the 'url' line must stay indented under 'repository'):

repository vendored
  url: file+noindex:vendor

active-repositories: vendored

If the directory is committed with the project, keep cabal's index cache out
of version control, for example by adding this line to .gitignore:

vendor/noindex.cache
